	width=&#34;1388&#34;
	height=&#34;548&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat1/2.1_hu_64ef9da584ea4a22.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat1/2.1_hu_3d6009f73a450fb1.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;253&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;607px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
选择反射型(Reflected),我们先输入一些东西进行观察。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat1/2.2.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1318&#34;
	height=&#34;790&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat1/2.2_hu_9d66bb0df1c622bb.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/phpchat1/2.2_hu_3ddbc83f5d4123e6.jpg 1024w&#34;
